		<div class="content-part-crabfatmagazine-container">        <div class="content-part-crabfatmagazine content-part-crabfatmagazine-container">
            <div class="container">
                <h1><b>About</b></h1>
                     <div class="modifyDetails">
							<div class="custom_top_author">
								 
								<div class="author_imag 2">
								 <a href="https://crabfatmagazine.com/author/rafael-peck"><img src="https://crabfatmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Screenshot-2025-11-12-at-12.52.31-148x148.png" width="120" height="120" srcset="https://crabfatmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Screenshot-2025-11-12-at-12.52.31.png 2x" alt="Rafael Peck" class="avatar avatar-120 wp-user-avatar wp-user-avatar-120 alignnone photo" /></a>
							    </div>		 
								<div class="custom_author_info">			
									<div class="name_author_out">	
										<span class="lbl"><b>Author : </b></span> 	
											<a href="https://crabfatmagazine.com/author/rafael-peck"><p>Rafael Peck</p></a>
									</div>	
									<div class="date-author-cl">
										<span><b>Last Update: </b></span> <span class="posttim posdate"> 8 December 2025</span>
									</div>	
								</div>
							</div>
			</div>                <p data-start="258" data-end="514">Welcome to Crabfat Magazine — your friendly guide to Florida online casinos.<br data-start="334" data-end="337" />We’re here to help you cut through the noise, understand what’s actually legal in Florida, and find safe, enjoyable places to play — especially sweepstakes and social casinos.</p>
<p data-start="516" data-end="675">If you ever feel unsure about a casino, a bonus, or the rules, you can always reach out to us at <strong data-start="613" data-end="644"><a data-start="615" data-end="642" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="96f5f9f8e2f7f5e2d6f5e4f7f4f0f7e2fbf7f1f7ecfff8f3b8f5f9fb">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></strong> and we’ll do our best to help.</p>
<hr data-start="677" data-end="680" />
<h3 data-start="682" data-end="697">Our Mission</h3>
<p data-start="699" data-end="827">Our mission is simple: <strong data-start="722" data-end="825">help Florida players enjoy online casino-style gaming safely, legally, and with clear expectations.</strong></p>
<p data-start="829" data-end="1110">Because real-money online casinos are heavily restricted in Florida and sweepstakes models can be confusing, we focus on explaining the rules in plain English, highlighting safe alternatives like sweepstakes casinos, and giving you practical tips on games, bonuses, and payments.</p>
<p data-start="1112" data-end="1288">We stay impartial by independently reviewing platforms, comparing pros and cons, and explaining legal and tax implications so you can make confident decisions, not rushed ones.</p>
<hr data-start="1290" data-end="1293" />
<h3 data-start="1295" data-end="1308">Our Story</h3>
<p data-start="1310" data-end="1636">Crabfat Magazine started when we noticed more Floridians searching for “real money online casinos” and landing on vague, pushy sites that barely mentioned legality or responsible gambling. Too many guides talked up big bonuses and jackpots while quietly skipping over Florida’s rules, tax implications, and age requirements.</p>
<p data-start="1638" data-end="2091">We created this site to fill that gap: clear guides, honest reviews, and practical explanations of how sweepstakes casinos work, how Gold Coins and Sweeps Coins are used, and what you actually need to know before you deposit or play. You can trust our team because we combine <strong data-start="1914" data-end="1989">iGaming research, digital compliance know-how, and real product testing</strong> — and we’d rather lose an affiliate commission than recommend a casino we wouldn’t play at ourselves.</p>
<hr data-start="2093" data-end="2096" />
<h3 data-start="2098" data-end="2125">What Makes Us Different</h3>
<ul data-start="2127" data-end="2978">
<li data-start="2127" data-end="2375">
<p data-start="2129" data-end="2375"><strong data-start="2129" data-end="2172">No paid influence or sponsored rankings</strong><br data-start="2172" data-end="2175" />We don’t sell “top spot” rankings to the highest bidder. If we receive compensation through affiliate links, we’ll tell you — and we’ll still call out slow withdrawals, clunky apps, or weak bonuses.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2377" data-end="2676">
<p data-start="2379" data-end="2676"><strong data-start="2379" data-end="2421">Real experts, not bots or spun content</strong><br data-start="2421" data-end="2424" />Our content is researched, written, or fact-checked by humans who understand online gambling laws, sweepstakes models, and casino products. We review game libraries, mobile performance, and payment options, then present both strengths and weaknesses.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2678" data-end="2978">
<p data-start="2680" data-end="2978"><strong data-start="2680" data-end="2716">Independent, user-first guidance</strong><br data-start="2716" data-end="2719" />We look at what matters most to players: legality in Florida, safety, bonus terms, withdrawal times, and responsible gambling tools. Our goal is not to push you to play more — it’s to help you make <strong data-start="2919" data-end="2948">informed, healthy choices</strong> about where and how you play.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2980" data-end="2983" />
<h3 data-start="2985" data-end="3011">Privacy &amp; User Respect</h3>
<p data-start="3013" data-end="3113">We believe you should be able to research Florida online casinos <strong data-start="3078" data-end="3113">without giving up your privacy.</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3115" data-end="3489">
<li data-start="3115" data-end="3167">
<p data-start="3117" data-end="3167">You can browse Crabfat Magazine <strong data-start="3149" data-end="3164">anonymously</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3168" data-end="3242">
<p data-start="3170" data-end="3242">We <strong data-start="3173" data-end="3204">don’t ask for personal data</strong> just to read our guides or reviews.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3243" data-end="3342">
<p data-start="3245" data-end="3342">We <strong data-start="3248" data-end="3297">never sell or trade your personal information</strong> to casinos, advertisers, or third parties.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3343" data-end="3489">
<p data-start="3345" data-end="3489">Any tracking we use is for basic analytics and affiliate attribution so we can keep the site running and understand what content helps you most.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3491" data-end="3607">We want you to feel safe not just when you play at an online casino, but also when you’re researching where to play.</p>
<hr data-start="3609" data-end="3612" />
<h3 data-start="3614" data-end="3625">Contact</h3>
<p data-start="3627" data-end="3937">Got a question about a specific Florida sweepstakes casino, a bonus term you don’t understand, or whether a site looks legit?<br data-start="3752" data-end="3755" />You can reach us anytime at <strong data-start="3783" data-end="3814"><a data-start="3785" data-end="3812" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7c1f1312081d1f083c1f0e1d1e1a1d08111d1b1d06151219521f1311">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></strong>. Every reply comes from a <strong data-start="3841" data-end="3856">real person</strong> familiar with Florida’s online gambling landscape — not a generic support bot.</p>
<p data-start="3939" data-end="4055">Whether you’re a cautious beginner or an experienced player double-checking a new brand, we’d love to hear from you.</p>
<p data-start="4161" data-end="4379"><br data-start="4193" data-end="4196" /></p>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
